# Local overrides only. Never put credentials, the training key or the origin secret in this file.
# Production sets these two resource NAMES (not values) through CI; leave them unset locally
# and the service fails closed (403 without the origin header, 503 with one).
# TRAINING_PROXY_KEY_PARAMETER=/wildduck-spam-trainer/prod/training-proxy-key
# ORIGIN_VERIFY_SECRET_ID=wildduck-spam-trainer/prod/origin-verify-key
# Upstream base URLs are fixed in code. Override them only to point at a local
# stand-in (HTTPS, or plain HTTP to localhost/127.0.0.1/[::1]); never at production.
# TRAINING_API_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8080/_mail-training/v1
# TRAINING_LEARN_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8081/_mail-training/v1
